# Go
/vantage
*.test
*.out

# web/dist — the built frontend — is TRACKED on purpose, the way polyclav
# tracks its web export. //go:embed tolerates an empty directory, so an
# untracked export meant every build path that skipped `just web-sync` shipped a
# placeholder page: `go build` on a fresh clone, and `go install …@latest`, whose
# module zip is whatever git holds. Tracking it is what makes those work.
# See docs/design/pypi-distribution.md §4.1. Refresh it with `just web-sync`
# (or `just build`) and commit the result; `just build-bin` embeds it as-is.

